eplacing real estate agents—and ultimately failed.\r\n\r\nThe founders of Compass, on the other hand, recognize how crucial real estate agents are to the marketplace. By empowering real estate agents with an AI-powered end-to-end platform, Compass solves industry inefficiencies and delivers exceptional service to both buyers and sellers, who are saved from a complex and stressful process. And the agents themselves are able to win more listings, better properties and generate more commission income than they would at a traditional brokerage. We call that a win-win-win.","Learn how Compass has unlocked the secrets of the real estate industry to develop a headache-free platform adored by agents, buyers and sellers alike.","Compass - IVP Portfolio Companies - Real Estate Tech VC","Compass - IVP Portfolio Companies ","The first technology-driven real estate platform of its kind, Compass combines exceptional agents with best-in-class technology to make the process of buying, selling and renting a home intelligent and seamless.","A modern real estate platform pairing top talent with technology to simplify the search and sell process",{"id":26,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"assetUrlXl":9,"assetUrlXxl":9},"167","2015-01-01","https://careers.ivp.com/companydetail.php?cid=8223&v=27","Robert Reffkin","/compass-transforming-the-real-estate-market-with-an-advanced-technology-platform/","Read the Funding Announcement","https://www.linkedin.com/company/compassinc/",{"id":34,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":35,"assetUrlXs":36,"assetUrlSm":37,"assetUrlMd":38,"assetUrlLg":39,"assetUrlXl":40,"assetUrlXxl":41},"169","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/169/Compass.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/169/xs_Compass.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/169/sm_Compass.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/169/md_Compass.jpg","https://assets.ivp